WEBVTT

00:00:03.335 --> 00:00:06.670
Chatbot era's over. I'll deploy one agent. Just the one.

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:16.675
Those brains aren't ours. They're on loan. Next month they get swapped.

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:23.345
Reporting in. They fined me. I didn't even do anything.

00:00:23.345 --> 00:00:26.680
Rent the brain if you like. The stamp and the buttons stay in our building.

